# [The False Choir](choir_relic_doc)

**Storm is wrong about this one, and the crew finds out from the inside.**

The lead is real, the reading is real, and the ruin is the wrong ruin. It is the same shape
as the Voice - boxes, right angles, a transmitter bay at the bottom of a shaft - because
somebody COPIED the Voice, badly, a long time after the giants were gone. The cradle is
there. The machine is there. It has never worked and it was never going to.

That is the beat: an archaeologist backing a hunch, a crew flying four rooms to the bottom
of it, and an empty cradle. What is down there instead is the reason the copy exists, and
the reason is the next heading.

**The geometry is the tell**, for anyone who has flown the Voice: the same rooms in the
same order and all of it slightly too small, because the builders were working from the
outside of something they had only seen once.

